# This repository is PUBLIC. Nothing secret and nothing the assignment forbids
# committing may be tracked here. hw4/.gitignore covers the project itself; these
# patterns protect the repository root, where the data pack is meant to be unpacked.

# Secrets
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key

# The assignment forbids committing the database or the product images. The README asks
# you to unpack them here, beside hw4/, so they are ignored here by name as well.
data hw4/
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
products/

# OS cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
